# Ultra Hub

CoreBlow skill and plugin marketplace.

## When to Use
 "Install skill", "Search marketplace", "Update skills", "List installed"

## Workflow
1. Search available skills in marketplace
2. Check compatibility and dependencies
3. Install to `ultra-skills/` directory
4. Verify SKILL.md loads correctly
5. Auto-reload via SkillsManager
